  "description": "NOW WITH POWERFUL HYDRAULIC DISC BRAKES! Think of this as a Kilo TT on steroids, a Kilo TT turbo-charged, sport SUV. With this Kilo GX T11 comes with 700x40c and you know Wide Tires Fit up to 1.75\"x29 and 700x45c. With rear braze-ons, you can rack it up and really haul.\n\nCustomers tell us this is one of the best ugly weather / winter-bikes you can possibly ride. Put on some 1.75\" x 29er tires and run over just about anything, anytime and anywhere.\n\nPlease Compare to Bianchi, Surly and other High Grade steel bikes at $1400+. Direct comparison to any high quality wide-tired, high grade steel bike will showcase the fantastic frame quality. At $686-799 delivered, there is no better value in it's class You'll have to look hard to try to find a magic riding, super durable, high grade steel bike with specs as good as the Kilo GX Series for even double the price.",
